      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "7531fcc5-ee95-4d41-ad9d-29afe0f34e3e",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "78e198ce-a4cd-41ed-a749-7488a497155a",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "c5643327-bc4d-42da-a3f3-49a859a345ed",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Mara asks whether\nthe newer sale\nproposal means she\nmust call a\nprivate estate",
                      "office. Consider\nthe dates,\nsignatures, and\nthe rule about\nentering a deed.",
                      "Which conclusion\ncan the clerk\nsupport? Pip will\nput it on her\nreferral card and",
                      "sign his name, so\na confident guess\ncould send her\nback into the\ncold."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "3628e8a6-6f77-4403-ac87-ac4433d707f6",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
